                    {
                        "sense_id": "f997c5e0-36e0-3268-9c55-c8616895855a",
                        "entry_id": "0a5d41d3-74b3-3705-bd27-8c54e056ca5d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "abortive, failed"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6082ff96-4d40-4427-b738-26d8d607fddd",
                                "sense_id": "f997c5e0-36e0-3268-9c55-c8616895855a",
                                "text": "Пото́м сказа́ла, что ей уже́ пора́ на рабо́ту, и повела́ несостоя́вшегося любо́вника к метро́ са́мой пу́таной доро́гой, что́бы, оконча́тельно протрезве́в, он никогда́ не нашёл пути́ к её кварти́ре.",
                                "translation": "Then she said it was time for her to go to work, and led her failed lover to the subway by the most tangled route possible so that when he finally sobered up, he would never be able to find the way back to her apartment.",
                                "english": "Then she said it was time for her to go to work, and led her failed lover to the subway by the most tangled route possible so that when he finally sobered up, he would never be able to find the way back to her apartment."
